      "message": "\u003e And BTW I suppose the reason why Chuanxiao didn\u0027t originally add propagation of that -ENOSPC error to the host is to let the host \"successfully\" print at least a part of the vmexit data - that part that fits in the buffer?\n\nYes, without propagating the error code to the host, the already dumped vmexit data can still be printed.\n\nAnd the not dumped vmexit data won\u0027t be lost unless we re-enable the trace, so if we keep dumping the trace without re-enable it, we will eventually get all the vmexit data.",
